<title>USA: Hudson Foods Inc Q1 Dec 28 EPS flat.</title>
<headline>Hudson Foods Inc Q1 Dec 28 EPS flat.</headline>
<dateline>ROGERS, Ark. 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>THREE MONTHS ENDED		  DEC 28, 1996     DEC 30, 1995</p>
<p> Sales					$391,280	   $340,674</p>
<p> Gross profit				 50,873	     46,917</p>
<p> Net income				    9,243		8,999</p>
<p> EPS						0.30		 0.30</p>
<p> Number shrs: Primary &amp; fully diluted 30,470	     30,404</p>
<p> Sales Growth				  14.9%		21.7%</p>
<p>Margins (Percent of Sales):</p>
<p>   Gross Profit				13.0%		13.8%</p>
<p>   Operating Income			   4.3%		 4.7%</p>
<p>   Income Before Income Taxes	     3.9%		 4.4%</p>
<p>   Net Income				   2.4%		 2.6%</p>
<p>		     (In thousands except per share data)</p>
</text>
